    "text": {
     "en": "A neighbourhood has places that give services: a library for books, a post office for letters, a market for goods and a bus stop for travel.\nPeople like postmen, bus conductors, shopkeepers and librarians work there.\nWe should respect their work and follow the rules in these places.\nVisit a place in your neighbourhood and find out what services it gives."
